      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Perhaps also enforcing a tagging system on groups such as what we do for uploads:\n\n- Suggestive/adult content\n\n(But then more fitting tags like)\n\n- Role Play\n\n- DJ Events (SFW)\n\n- DJ Events (Suggestive)\n\n- Drinking Events (which would fall under suggestive adult content)\n\nAny anything that is flagged as suggestive would automatically be hidden from anyone who has not been age verified.\n\nThe con is that we may see groups who desire discoverability and fast growth NOT adopt the right tags *just* so they can grow, but I think that ultimately the organizations who want to see change and a safer space for minors agree with the OP.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-08-29T12:26:21.198Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Just as the title says an 18 Plus only Group Setting. Make it so you can enable an 18 Plus setting. That way only 18 Plus verified accounts can join the group. It would help skip a lot of verification options for Groups like manually verifying upon requesting to join a group. It also prevents a lot of minors from joining inappropriate NSFW groups.\n\n(You could potentially make this a \"must have\" for any community featuring NSFW (Commonly sexually tinted) Content.)",
